# CLOCK Storybook generated/publication output
# Source stories/themes and the two approved pre-produced bumper clips stay tracked.
# Rendered tutorials, retained frame trees, publication staging, voice-over renders,
# subtitle sidecars and manifests are workstation output and must never be committed.
/tutorial-output/
/tutorial-output*/
docs/tutorials/generated/
docs/tutorials/.cache/
*.frames/
*.staging/
**/frames/frame-*.png
**/frames/frame-*.rgba
